(footprint "DIP-48_SocketStrip_SMD_W15.24mm_P2.54mm"
	(version 20240108)
	(generator "manual")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "48-position DIP socket field built from TWO 1x24 surface-mount socket strips (Samtec SSM-124-L-SV class), 2.54mm pitch, 15.24mm (0.6 inch) row spacing, pin 1 to pin 24 span 58.42mm. SURFACE MOUNT - nothing protrudes below the board, so the carrier mezzanine underneath is unobstructed. Tails are STAGGERED +-1.65mm about each row centreline, alternating, per the standard SMT socket-strip pattern; the row CENTRELINES are 15.24mm apart and are what the XGecu adapter pins seat on. Pad 1.9 x 1.0. Numbering is standard DIP: 1-24 down the x=0 row, 25-48 back up the x=15.24 row. Receives the male DIP48 pins of the XGecu adapter from above - not mirrored, adapter and socket are both viewed from the top. NOTE: 48 SMT contacts take the full DIP insertion force with no through-hole anchor; see docs/connector-pinout.md.")
	(tags "DIP48 socket smd surface-mount socket-strip 0.6inch XGecu")
